WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.233
Follow the connected cards from objective and facts, through options, to the

00:00:04.233 --> 00:00:08.467
decision needed. Explain the conflict clearly so the person deciding can compare

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:12.700
workable choices.

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:17.575
Notice the separate labels: received, decided and completed. A read receipt proves

00:00:17.575 --> 00:00:22.217
neither approval nor completion. Record the actual decision and follow through on

00:00:22.217 --> 00:00:26.858
the agreed action.

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:31.810
The three action cards are supersede, correct and verify receipt. Mark the

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:36.554
earlier message superseded rather than silently erasing it. Send the prominent correction,

00:00:36.554 --> 00:00:41.298
update the controlled record and check that affected people can act on

00:00:41.298 --> 00:00:46.042
the corrected information.
